    "updated_at": "2017-05-12T13:51:44Z",
    "body": "So we'd have some per-interface opt-in? And then I guess mixins would automatically get the behavior of the interface they mix in to. Seems OK I guess, although it's going to make the IDL for Element and Document (and Node? and EventTarget?) pretty hard to read.\r\n\r\nThen I guess we can name them [LegacyUnscopable] (per interface) and [LegacyScopable] (per member) since new members will get the right default, i.e. nobody should ever add any of these again to new APIs.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
