    "created_at": "2017-05-12T14:05:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-05-12T14:05:53Z",
    "body": "Hmm, yeah, I'm becoming less a fan of this idea when I consider how many members would get annotated with [LegacyScopable]...\r\n\r\nI also fear we'd have people who define new content attributes cargo-culting [LegacyScopable] onto their corresponding IDL attributes, like they currently do for [CEReactions]. That cargo-culting works well for [CEReactions], but would be the opposite of what we want for [LegacyScopable].",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
